  "name": "SW_MTI_SHA_2C",
  "alternateName": "Spherical harmonic model of the magnetic signature of oceanic M2 tide",
  "description": "This product contains the representation of a model of the magnetic field of the Lunar M 2 ocean tides using spherical harmonic coefficients. The model is estimated from Swarm and ground observatory data using the Comprehensive Inversion scheme within the Swarm Level 2 Processing system.",
